  },
  "-899059071": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Charlotte’s charm and adventurous spirit brought joy and laughter into our lives, while Anna’s warmth and nurturing nature provided a comforting stability.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "88952544": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "As the sun sets on another perfect day, I know that this is just the beginning of many more beautiful moments together. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "449206811": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Living together, we found a balance that worked for all of us. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1439341433": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Charlotte made me feel cherished and alive, and every day with her was filled with excitement and love.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1700839753": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "But what truly made this new life extraordinary was Anna’s acceptance. After initial hesitations and difficult conversations, she came to understand and support my relationship with Charlotte. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
